From 36dbad352b4e83abcd7874a0e03cf4016b4031ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mcpe500 <68177813+mcpe500@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:27:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ggml: iso3 (IsoQuant 3-bit) KV cache type, CPU + CUDA
 (green)

Type GGML_TYPE_ISO3_0 = 44, block 128 values / 50 bytes, layout of fork 08e025c.
CPU: ref quantize/dequantize, vec_dot iso3 x f32 (CPU flash attention).
CUDA: SET_ROWS f32->iso3, to_fp16/fp32 (contig + nc), FA via f16 conversion (no vec instance).
common: -ctk/-ctv/-ctkd/-ctvd accept iso3.

Verified on GTX 1070 Ti (sm_61): test-iso3 PASSED; test-quantize-fns rc 0;
test-backend-ops -b CUDA0 iso3 28/28, SET_ROWS,GET_ROWS,CPY,FLASH_ATTN_EXT 5041/5041;
ctest -L main (excl. tokenizer, backend-ops) rc 0.
